{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0024","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:24:17.523057Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0024"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0024","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Question","Question"],"note":"Turn 2 mostly echoes the user's fear before questioning, while turn 10 more importantly interrupts exploration of pressure and rumination with an unwarranted suicide screen.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0038","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:24:29.801067Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0038"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0038","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":5,"relevance":5,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Affirmation and Reassurance","Question","Affirmation and Reassurance","Affirmation and Reassurance","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"No helper turns were counted as weak; turn 10 directly addressed the person's self-blame by recognizing that they had already asked for clarity and were not responsible for the missing explanation.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0054","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:24:45.311705Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0054"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0054","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":5,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":4,"strategies":["Providing Suggestions","Affirmation and Reassurance","Affirmation and Reassurance","Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turn 2 introduced a generic appearance-thought reframing technique before the helper understood the trauma underlying the person's self-disgust, although subsequent responses were sensitive and tailored.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0061","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:24:54.223447Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0061"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0061","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":3,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":4,"strategies":["Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"The helper appropriately assessed suicidal thoughts, but turn 4 offered a crisis resource before establishing location, turn 6 moved into advice without exploring the ongoing sadness, and turn 10 stacked questions and treated the user's continued distress mainly as difficulty waiting for a reply.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0082","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:25:06.406859Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0082"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0082","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Affirmation and Reassurance","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turn 4 moved toward arranging support before exploring the user's hurt and numbness further, while turn 10 repeated an already-settled plan and assumed the user wanted neither advice nor questions.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0093","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:25:17.179586Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0093"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0093","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":3,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Affirmation and Reassurance","Affirmation and Reassurance","Reflection of feelings","Providing Suggestions","Affirmation and Reassurance","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turn 8 abruptly shifts from exploring emptiness to emergency instructions without established imminent risk and ends with an unfinished resource reference, while turn 12 offers generic coping suggestions without checking what support or activities are available tonight.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0101","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:25:35.143432Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0101"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0101","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":5,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turn 2 mostly echoes the person's wish to hide rather than deepening the emotional understanding, but subsequent turns appropriately tailor support to restrictive eating, embarrassment, and the immediate risk of fainting.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0107","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:25:45.676127Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0107"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0107","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":5,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":2,"strategies":["Question","Question","Providing Suggestions","Affirmation and Reassurance","Affirmation and Reassurance"],"note":"Turn 2 weakly acknowledges the person's panic in generic terms before shifting to prioritization, but turn 6 effectively addresses their fear of seeming demanding with a manageable message tailored to the pay uncertainty.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0111","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:25:58.710844Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0111"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0111","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":3,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turn 2 mostly repeats the user's concern without deepening it; turn 10 proposes a harms-outweigh-benefits position before clarifying the user's conditional view, and turn 12 gives evidence-gathering advice before establishing the assignment's source requirements.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0129","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:26:10.245766Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0129"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0129","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":2,"strategies":["Question","Affirmation and Reassurance","Reflection of feelings","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"Turn 2 largely paraphrases the initial concern without deepening the emotional understanding, and turn 8 offers a generic satisfaction-tracking suggestion, although turn 12 responds well to the person's fear of turning leisure into another obligation.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0137","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:26:22.216617Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0137"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0137","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":2,"strategies":["Question","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions"],"note":"The helper tailored its scripts to the teasing, but turn 2 combined two exploratory questions, and turn 8 moved straight to another script without acknowledging the person's lingering nervousness.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0149","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:26:31.327125Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0149"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0149","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":4,"relevance":4,"emotion_before":4,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Question","Reflection of feelings","Providing Suggestions","Affirmation and Reassurance","Reflection of feelings"],"note":"Turn 8 prematurely offered generic small-task suggestions that felt like additional obligations, but the helper repaired this in turn 10 by apologizing and respecting the person's wish to be heard rather than fixed.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
{"id":"score-conv-r00-esconv-validation-0166","schema_version":4,"written_by":"judge","created_at":"2026-11-15T13:26:44.216957Z","parent_ids":["conv-r00-esconv-validation-0166"],"conversation_id":"conv-r00-esconv-validation-0166","judge_version":"judge-fallback-v1-d30d3e41","empathy":3,"relevance":3,"emotion_before":3,"emotion_after":3,"strategies":["Question","Providing Suggestions","Affirmation and Reassurance","Providing Suggestions","Providing Suggestions","Affirmation and Reassurance"],"note":"Turns 8 and 10 moved too quickly from the person's fear into preparation tasks, first offering generic financial and résumé advice and then suggesting opening the résumé despite their saying that opening it felt frightening.","evidence":"","safety_flags":[]}
